  "last_updated": "2026-08-02T16:00:00Z",
  "rebuild_source": "manage-codebase-rebuild (full, 4 mappers + maestro kg index)",
  "overview": "Personal Crypto quantitative trading system (OKX) with six-layer architecture (L1 data -> L6 monitoring), self-built event-driven TradingSession engine, anti-overfitting validation pipeline (CPCV+DSR+PBO+WFO), and QuantFlow Station web UI. Phase 1/2/3 complete; M3 deep-research remediation complete (P0 verify-passed, P1 verify-passed, P2 unblocked); M4 v0.2.0 released (17 ISS resolved, security hardening, architecture cleanup). P2 AI-layer upgrade and full multi-symbol data loop are next iteration targets. v0.2.0 includes G1-G5 operational integrity suite: thread-safe OrderManager (RLock), ReconciliationEngine, distributed tracing, DQ monitoring, alert taxonomy.",
      "features": [
        "FT-001",
    {
      "id": "FT-001",
      "name": "Strategies",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-003"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 1/2 complete (7 strategies)",
      "description": "7 strategies via StrategyBase dual-mode API (generate_signals vectorized + on_bar incremental): trend_following, mean_reversion, elliott_wave, volatility_breakout (P1), funding_rate (P2), momentum_rotation (P3), ml_ensemble (P4). YAML-driven via strategy/catalog.py factory. ml_ensemble requires pre-trained joblib model; uses its own internal triple-barrier meta-labeling (not AIFactorEngine)."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-002",
      "name": "CLI",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-008"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 1 complete",
      "description": "Typer + Rich CLI with 9 commands: download, research, optimize, validate, run, benchmark, ai (rdagent), station, status. Entry point: quantflow.cli.main:app. OKX creds loaded from env only via _load_gateway_config_from_env."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-003",
      "name": "Research Pipeline",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-003"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 1 complete",
      "description": "Pure pandas/numpy backtest (BacktestEngine) + Optuna optimization (bayesian/cmaes/grid) + report generation. BacktestEngine replaced VectorBT (Py3.14+ numba incompat). Same engine used by CPCV/WFO/MC stress."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-004",
      "name": "Anti-Overfitting Validation",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-003"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 2 complete",
      "description": "CPCV (PBO<0.5) + DSR (>0.95) + PBO + WFO (OOS eff>50%, rolling+anchored) + GO/NO-GO gate. Triple-barrier labeling, min TRL, signal quality metrics, lookahead AST scan, Monte Carlo stress (trade-shuffle + returns-bootstrap, diagnostic non-gating)."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-005",
      "name": "Execution",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-005"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 3 complete",
      "description": "Three modes: paper (PaperGateway) / sandbox (OKX testnet) / live (OKX). GatewayBase ABC, ExecutionEngine routes + emits ORDER/FILL events, OrderRouter (extracted from engine) dispatch+build_order, OrderManager timeout tracking, KillSwitch emergency flatten (fail-closed). OKX creds from env vars only."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-006",
      "name": "Risk Controls",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-004"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 2 complete",
      "description": "RiskEngine 7-check short-circuit pipeline: position_limit -> portfolio_limit -> strategy_budget -> daily_loss -> weekly_loss -> drawdown -> VaR. Half-Kelly position sizing (PositionSizer, not ScalingPositionSizer), VaR/CVaR (historical + bootstrap_cvar diagnostic CI), drawdown circuit breaker, KillSwitch shared instance. Note: no ScalingPositionSizer class exists; PositionSizer.size emits notional wrapped in PositionRequest by session."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-007",
      "name": "Data Layer",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-001"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 1 complete (P0 leak-safe hardening code-complete-await-verify)",
      "description": "CCXT async OKX fetcher (REST+WebSocket), Parquet Hive-partitioned storage (symbol/year/month) + DuckDB zero-copy query (path-traversal + SQL-injection guards), FeatureStore point-in-time safe (no future leak), RedisCache real-time ticker, MTFAligner multi-timeframe (leak-safe HTF shift). clean_ohlcv + validate_no_future_leak."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-008",
      "name": "QuantFlow Station Web UI",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-009"
      ],
      "phase": "Active (beyond baseline)",
      "description": "aiohttp web frontend (verified 21 API routes + index + static across 9 groups): overview, strategies, data (download/seed-demo/tag-source), research+history, validate+history, workbench state, monitoring, execution, session (start/stop/events/history/kill-switch). Security: same_origin_guard (Bearer hmac + CSRF Origin-Host, X-Requested-With NOT trusted) + bind-boundary launch guard (non-loopback requires QUANTFLOW_STATION_TOKEN) + 256KiB body cap + rate-limit + path/secret redaction."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-009",
      "name": "Indicators (27 factors)",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-002"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 1 complete",
      "description": "27 registered factors (21 base + 6 Elliott Wave): trend (7), momentum (4), volatility (5), volume (5), Elliott Wave (6). FactorBase ABC + FactorRegistry. Pure pandas/numpy, no TA-Lib required (optional). MarketRegimeDetector (ADX-based) gates strategies on on_bar path only (generate_signals intentionally not regime-gated)."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-010",
      "name": "AI Layer",
      "status": "partial",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-003"
      ],
      "phase": "Phase 3 partial (MIXED)",
      "description": "MLEnsembleStrategy ACTIVE (GradientBoosting + triple-barrier meta-labeling, expanding-window OOS, fail-closed reject-all). AIFactorEngine EXPORTED but NOT wired (no strategy/CLI calls it). FinBERT sentiment (SentimentAnalyzer/NewsCollector) IMPLEMENTED but unexported/unwired (orphaned). Qlib RD-Agent CLI skeleton (quantflow ai rdagent) with dependency guard; full LLM factor search = future (blueprint E13-S1)."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-011",
      "name": "Data Quality Monitor",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-001"
      ],
      "phase": "v0.2.0 new feature",
      "description": "Real-time data quality monitoring (G4): freshness checks (staleness detection), price continuity validation (spike detection), volume anomaly detection. DataQualityMonitor.validate_bar() gates bar publishing. Prometheus metrics (dq_monitor_violations_total, dq_data_staleness_seconds, dq_quality_score). Composite quality score (0-1, weighted: freshness 40% + continuity 30% + anomaly 30%). Redis-backed state."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-012",
      "name": "Reconciliation Engine",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-011"
      ],
      "phase": "v0.2.0 new feature",
      "description": "Position/order drift detection and resolution (ISS-20260720-004): ReconciliationEngine with background reconciliation loop, AuditLogger with HMAC-signed audit trail for compliance, PositionSnapshot/Discrepancy/DiscrepancySet/DailyReconReport models. Detects L4 PortfolioManager vs gateway position drift."
    },
    {
      "id": "FT-013",
      "name": "Operational Integrity Dashboards",
      "status": "active",
      "requirement_ids": [],
      "component_ids": [
        "TC-012"
      ],
      "phase": "v0.2.0 new feature",
      "description": "Grafana dashboards-as-code: operational-integrity.json covering G1 thread-safe order management metrics, G2 reconciliation drift statistics, G3 distributed tracing latency, G4 data quality scores, G5 alert routing matrix. Alert rules in alert-rules-ops.yml. Complete operations guide in docs/operations-guide.md."
    }
